DESCRIPTION:Category: Peer Support\nCost: FREE\nFormat: In-person\nAddress:
  464 SE 185th Ave\, Suite 315\, Portland\, OR 97233\nPhone: 503-228-5692\n
 Website: https://namimultnomah.org\nDetails: No diagnosis required for any
  groups. Groups are peer-led by trained volunteers with lived experience. 
 NAMI Multnomah also runs family and caregiver groups that are deliberately
  not listed here\, because this database covers groups people attend for t
 heir own support - Family Support Group (Mondays 6-7:30pm\, 1st Monday in 
 person at Rose City Community Collective)\, Parent Support Group (1st & 3r
 d Wednesdays 4-5:15pm)\, and Military Family Support Group (2nd Thursday 6
 -7:30pm). Refer family members to namimultnomah.org/family-support-groups 
 or 503-228-5692.
