UID:0870cb364bf69dbd@portlandresources.org
DTSTAMP:20260807T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260101T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260101T220000
SUMMARY:4D Recovery: Drop-In Center
DESCRIPTION:Category: Peer Support\nCost: FREE\nInfo: Welcoming space with 
 pool table\, video games\, TV\, and peer connection. Come hang out\, no pr
 essure.\nAddress: 324 NE 9th St.\, Gresham\, OR 97030\nPhone: 971-703-4623
 \nWebsite: https://4drecovery.org/\nDetails: Youth-focused (14-35) recover
 y community with peer mentors. Smit Center (Gresham) is the Multnomah Coun
 ty location. The long-standing "closed/relocating" question is resolved (A
 ugust 2026) - the Gresham drop-in center is operating daily 2-10pm. The se
 parate new NE Portland Youth & Family Recovery Campus (NE 100th & E Burnsi
 de\, days from opening) was destroyed by an arson fire on April 11-12\, 20
 26\; 4D is fundraising to rebuild it (KATU\, May 5 2026). That campus neve
 r opened\, so no published services were lost. Previous SE 11th Ave Portla
 nd location is closed.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//EN"><HTML><BODY><p><strong>Category:</strong> Peer Support</p><p><strong>Cost:</strong> FREE</p><p>Welcoming space with pool table, video games, TV, and peer connection. Come hang out, no pressure.</p><p><strong>Address:</strong> 324 NE 9th St., Gresham, OR 97030</p><p><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:971-703-4623">971-703-4623</a></p><p><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://4drecovery.org/">https://4drecovery.org/</a></p><p><strong>Details:</strong> Youth-focused (14-35) recovery community with peer mentors. Smit Center (Gresham) is the Multnomah County location. The long-standing &quot;closed/relocating&quot; question is resolved (August 2026) - the Gresham drop-in center is operating daily 2-10pm. The separate new NE Portland Youth &amp; Family Recovery Campus (NE 100th &amp; E Burnside, days from opening) was destroyed by an arson fire on April 11-12, 2026; 4D is fundraising to rebuild it (KATU, May 5 2026). That campus never opened, so no published services were lost. Previous SE 11th Ave Portland location is closed.</p></BODY></HTML>
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-BUSYSTATUS:FREE
LOCATION:324 NE 9th St.\, Gresham\, OR 97030
