 ://www.portlandhearingvoices.net\nDetails: Peer-led support groups for peo
 ple who hear voices\, see visions\, or have unusual beliefs/sensory experi
 ences. In-person group confirmed active at BHRC\, Wednesdays 9:30-10:30am 
