DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260808T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260808T120000
SUMMARY:Food Court 5000 (Lloyd Center Mall Walking): Final Lloyd Center Wal
 k (Silent Disco)
DESCRIPTION:Category: Fitness & Wellness\nCost: FREE\nInfo: One last walk o
 n the mall's closing day\, with Heartbeat Silent Discos and Snap! Dance Pa
 rty (~150 headphone sets\, $10 reservation). Starts 11am in the food court
 . Part of the Aug 8 farewell day (Lloyderpalooza\, Pedalpalooza funeral ri
 de\, Lloyd Fest 4-7pm).\nAddress: 2201 Lloyd Center\, Portland\, OR 97232\
 nWebsite: https://foodcourt5k.com/\nDetails: 1980s/90s-themed indoor mall 
 walking. Dress code: neon leggings\, acid-washed denim encouraged. Groups 
 of 70+ regular attendees. Post-walk snacks at food court. Lloyd Center clo
 ses permanently August 8\, 2026 - the last regular Sunday walk inside the 
 mall is August 2\, with a final farewell walk on Saturday August 8. The gr
 oup continues afterward at rotating pop-up locations around Portland (some
  outdoors for late summer\, some indoors)\; a permanent home is reportedly
  close to being finalized but was not announced as of late July 2026.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//EN"><HTML><BODY><p><strong>Category:</strong> Fitness &amp; Wellness</p><p><strong>Cost:</strong> FREE</p><p>One last walk on the mall&#x27;s closing day, with Heartbeat Silent Discos and Snap! Dance Party (~150 headphone sets, $10 reservation). Starts 11am in the food court. Part of the Aug 8 farewell day (Lloyderpalooza, Pedalpalooza funeral ride, Lloyd Fest 4-7pm).</p><p><strong>Address:</strong> 2201 Lloyd Center, Portland, OR 97232</p><p><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://foodcourt5k.com/">https://foodcourt5k.com/</a></p><p><strong>Details:</strong> 1980s/90s-themed indoor mall walking. Dress code: neon leggings, acid-washed denim encouraged. Groups of 70+ regular attendees. Post-walk snacks at food court. Lloyd Center closes permanently August 8, 2026 - the last regular Sunday walk inside the mall is August 2, with a final farewell walk on Saturday August 8. The group continues afterward at rotating pop-up locations around Portland (some outdoors for late summer, some indoors); a permanent home is reportedly close to being finalized but was not announced as of late July 2026.</p></BODY></HTML>
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-BUSYSTATUS:FREE
LOCATION:2201 Lloyd Center\, Portland\, OR 97232
URL:https://foodcourt5k.com/
