SUMMARY:Tualatin Heritage Center: Northwest Fossil Fest
DESCRIPTION:Category: Arts & Culture\nCost: FREE\nInfo: 2026 date confirmed
  as August 1. Draws 400+ visitors - arrive early.\nAddress: 8700 SW Sweek 
 Drive\, Tualatin\, OR 97062\nPhone: 503-885-1926\nWebsite: https://www.tua
 latinhistory.org\nDetails: Free local history museum with excellent family
  events. Fossil Fest is a highlight - 400+ attendees. Re-tiered from annua
 l to quarterly audits in July 2026 - an annual cadence let the whole progr
 am list sit a full year stale\, still advertising 2025 dates.
